1
00:00:00,598 --> 00:00:02,023
Americans spent more,

2
00:00:02,157 --> 00:00:05,360
but inflation erased the gain in after-tax income.

3
00:00:06,615 --> 00:00:09,653
Today's federal report puts annual price growth at

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,507
three point four percent,

5
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:13,533
above the Fed's two percent goal.

6
00:00:15,607 --> 00:00:17,842
After-tax income rose in August.

7
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,481
Prices rose, too,

8
00:00:19,642 --> 00:00:21,086
leaving buying power flat.

9
00:00:21,468 --> 00:00:22,624
Spending still grew,

10
00:00:22,786 --> 00:00:24,189
even after inflation.

11
00:00:25,374 --> 00:00:26,342
The next test:

12
00:00:26,476 --> 00:00:28,741
can income start outpacing prices?

13
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,637
That's what gives households more room to breathe.
